U|                         That's him when he was twelve, back 
U|                         in 1919. Something happens here you'll 
U|                         have to remember later on.
O|
N,G|               Series of shots as four or five boys make the slide down the 
N|               hill and out onto the ice. As each boy comes down the others 
N|               applaud.
