N|               seventeenth century garment which looks like a baby's night 
N|               shirt  with embroidered cuffs and collar, and gathered at 
N|               the neck with a drawstring. It falls below his knees.  The 
N|               tollkeeper is seated against the wall eyeing them 
N|               suspiciously. Throughout the scene he attempts to spit, but 
N|               each time is stopped by some amazing thing Clarence does or 
N|               says.  Clarence becomes aware that his garment is amazing 
N|               the tollkeeper.
